   "slot_y": 0,
   "unique_name": "Maligaro's Virtuosity",
   "additional_text": "\n\n<m>{<gold>{MANDATORY: Maligaro's Virtuosity}}\n<gold>{Locks crit damage high -> crit-chance downsides stop mattering -> Pinpoint Critical becomes free power. Scale crit CHANCE, never crit damage. 40-50% works, 60-70% strong endgame target - do not sacrifice everything chasing more.}"
  },
  {
   "additional_text": "Sekhema Sandals\n1. +25% to Fire Resistance\n2. +40% to Cold Resistance\n3. +30% to Lightning Resistance\n4. +51 to maximum Energy Shield\n5. 55% increased Energy Shield\n6. 30% increased Movement Speed\n\n<grey>{Movement speed first, then ES/res.}",
   "inventory_id": "Boots1",
   "level_interval": [
    80,
    100
   ],
   "slot_x": 0,
   "slot_y": 0
  },
  {
   "additional_text": "Gold Amulet\n1. +14% to all Elemental Resistances\n2. +33 to Strength\n3. +79 to maximum Energy Shield\n4. +3 to Level of all Spell Skills\n5. +50 to Spirit\n\n<m>{<gold>{ANOINT - pick by situation:}}\n<gold>{Need mana -> Conservative Casting\nMana solved -> Climate Change\nWant an ascendancy point back -> Aspiring Genius (replaces Constant Gale)\nAdvanced tech -> Dominion (video guide)\nExtreme budget only -> Heavy Ammunition}\n<gold>{Solar Amulet implicit = 15 spirit; prefix 30-50 more.}",
   "inventory_id": "Amulet1",
   "level_interval": [
    35,
    100
   ],
   "slot_x": 0,
   "slot_y": 0
  },
  {
   "additional_text": "Rawhide Belt\n1. +119 to maximum Life\n2. +35% to Fire Resistance\n3. +61 to maximum Energy Shield\n4. 13 Life Regeneration per second\n5. 49% increased Spell Damage during any Flask Effect\n6. 16% increased Cast Speed during any Flask Effect\n\n<grey>{ES, mana, res. Flask mana recovery rate = strong roll.}",
   "inventory_id": "Belt1",
