 "description": "<m>{<gold>{SPARK / ORB OF STORMS / COC COMET}}\n<gold>{Philosophy: Spark + Orb of Storms clear the map. Comet is the nuke for rares, rituals, juiced content, bosses. Do NOT build around raining weak Comets on white mobs.}\n\n<b>{MAPPING LOOP: }<gold>{Drop Orb of Storms -> cast Spark through it -> Mana Tempest BEFORE scary packs (proactive, not panic) -> Sigil when you can preload -> keep moving.}\n<b>{BOSS PRELOAD: }<gold>{Sigil -> Elemental Weakness -> Frost Bomb as boss becomes vulnerable -> Orb of Storms -> Spark -> Mana Tempest in the burst window -> Comets shotgun.}\n\n<b>{WEAPON SETS: }<gold>{Set 1 = damage (Spark, Orb of Storms, Cast on Critical). Set 2 = utility preload (Frost Bomb, Elemental Weakness). Flexible: Sigil, Mana Tempest, Convalescence.}\n\n<b>{SPIRIT: 181 total. }<gold>{Sources: 100 campaign quests, 35-50 staff amanamu prefix, 15 Solar Amulet implicit, 30-50 amulet prefix, 30-61 body prefix, 20-30 helm corruption.}\n\n<b>{DEFENSE: }<gold>{Not a face-tank build. Freeze, range, offscreen kills ARE the defense; Convalescence recovers ES when it goes wrong.}\n\n<grey>{Gold = creator guide (updated Jul 10). Grey = general wisdom/tracker.}",
